<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE - Polk County, Fla., waste bonds.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE - Polk County, Fla., waste bonds.</headline>
<text>
<p>POLK COUNTY INDUSTRIAL DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $75,000,000</p>
<p>(FLORIDA)</p>
<p>SOLID WASTE DISPOSAL FACILITY REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1996</p>
<p>(TAMPA ELECTRIC COMPANY PROJECT)</p>
<p>TAMPA ELECTRIC COMPANY</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed and the bonds are free to trade.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Citicorp Securities, Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
